  "legalDraftNote": "Draft text. Requires review by legal and pharmacy professionals before launch.",
  "privacyBody": "DARMAN processes your phone number, name, delivery addresses, order history and, if you choose, prescription photos — only to place and fulfil orders, let a pharmacist review prescriptions and provide support. Prescription files are kept in private storage; only you and an authorised pharmacist can access them and every access is logged. You can request deletion of your account and data at any time in Profile. We do not sell personal data.",
  "termsBody": "DARMAN is a service for finding products and placing orders with partner pharmacies. Prescription-only products are released only after a pharmacist reviews the prescription. Information in the app is for reference and does not replace professional advice. Availability, prices and delivery times are set by the pharmacy; stated delivery times are estimates. An order can be cancelled until the pharmacy starts preparing it.",
